invalid type: string "AUTHORITY: Dhaka Water Supply and Sewerage Authority (DWASA)\n\nCATEGORY: Water / Sewerage\n\nEVIDENCE:\nDhaka WASA has the mandate to provide water supply and sewage disposal services in Dhaka. Its responsibilities include providing safe and adequate drinking water and the collection, treatment and disposal of sewage.\n\nSOURCE:\npage.", expected i64Y 2024-25.", expected a b